    bilinear, bicubic and trilinear for 3D, 4D and 5D input Tensor,
    respectively.

    One can either give a :attr:`scale_factor` or the target output :attr:`size` to
    calculate the output size. (You cannot give both, as it is ambiguous)

    Args:
